<center><font class="option"><b>RAISTALLA</b></font></center><br><P align=center><STRONG>MADONNA DANCER LAUNCHES HER DEBUT VIDEO! <BR><BR>RAISTALLA aka RAIS <BR>RELEASES HER FIRST MUSIC VIDEO!!!</STRONG></P>
<P align=justify><BR>After performing for several years, in the entertainment industry, as a professional dancer touring with top artists such as Madonna, Akon, Outkast, Missy Elliot, Alicia Keys, Christina Aguilera, and more. <BR>The time has come for the <STRONG>Funk Pop Princess</STRONG>, RAIS, to emerge as an artist and take center stage as a singer/performer. <BR>Her debut album "RAISTALLA" was a tool for her to physically show her transformation from dancer to singer/performing artist. </P>
<P align=center><EM>"I’m a performer. I become the scenario and manifest it through music and dance!"</EM> </P>
<p align=center><a href="/images/2007/raistalla.jpg" target=_blank><img src="/images/2007/raistalla_small.jpg" border="0"></a></p>
<P align=justify>Now that her album has served its purpose, she has found the direction to take her new sound to the next level. It’s called "Electro-Funk." It’s an exciting fusion of Pop, Funk, and Electronica, and it starts with her new single "Shut It Down." <BR>This song is about busting your moves! It’s about that feeling you get when you walk in a party and you know the dance floor is yours! Whether you are Krunking, Klowning, Stepping, Locking, Popping, Breaking, or Freestyling! Whatever it is you’re shutting it down to, that’s all that matters! </P>
