	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>Journalist <STRONG>Roland Borka</STRONG> sent us a scan from his newspaper <STRONG>Uj Szo</STRONG>. The article is about <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s new house in <STRONG>London</STRONG>.</P>
