<P><STRONG>Demi Moore</STRONG> and her hubby <STRONG>Ashton Kutcher</STRONG>, <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>, <STRONG>Janet Jackson</STRONG>, <STRONG>Shakira</STRONG>, and <STRONG>Penelope Cruz</STRONG> all met each other at <STRONG>NYC</STRONG> HotSpot <STRONG>Butter </STRONG>for a night of partying. <BR><BR>If you haven’t been to <STRONG>Butter</STRONG>, it’s actually a pretty small place, so if all these celebs were there, I bet they only let about 5 ‘average’ people in. And when I say ‘average,’ I’m talking about girls that look like supermodels but they’re ‘average’ in the sense that they’re not celebrities. Everyone else waits outside in the cold. </P>
