<P>A bandana-ed <STRONG>Ashton</STRONG> and wife <STRONG>Demi</STRONG> were at <STRONG>Bungalow 8</STRONG> in <STRONG>Manhattan</STRONG> last night, Rambo-style. Bosom buddies <STRONG>Penelope</STRONG> <STRONG>Cruz</STRONG> and <STRONG>Shakira</STRONG> partied with the couple in the tropical lounge.</P>
<P>Further downtown, <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> visited <STRONG>Butter</STRONG>. Two minutes after <STRONG>Madge</STRONG>’s big arrival, <STRONG>Shakira</STRONG> arrived holding the hand of a gentlemen friend. <STRONG>Ashton</STRONG>, <STRONG>Demi</STRONG> and <STRONG>Penelope Cruz</STRONG> followed closely behind. <STRONG>Janet Jackson</STRONG> stopped by while boytoy <STRONG>Jermaine Dupree</STRONG> was out on the west coast. </P>
